   "en": "The ⟦0⟧, also known as the ⟦1⟧ or ⟦2⟧ is a major country stretching across Eastern Europe and the northern parts of Asia with a population of ⟦3⟧. The USSR is the leader of the ⟦4⟧ faction, consisting of ⟦5⟧ and ⟦6⟧.",
