   "k": "kthtqh",
   "en": "In many ways, the USSR is the epicenter of Communist ideology, which finds itself at odds with many of their neighbors. With various territorial disputes with ⟦0⟧, the Baltic States and ⟦1⟧ to the west, and frequent border clashes with ⟦2⟧ to the east.",
