  {
   "k": "t4q27z",
   "en": "Despite its large amount of manpower and natural resources, the country's stability is torn apart as a result of old power struggles and paranoia, with purges on a regular basis intended to root out all conspirators with often detrimental side effects to the efficiency of management, production and command. Their military is in need of rapid modernization in multiple aspects to keep up with their European neighbors. And the Five Year Plan has only just started recently and would still require effort and time to reap the fruits."
